        "kind": "pull_request",
        "title": "fix(mattermost): bound websocket handshake waits at 30s",
        "body": "## What Problem This Solves\r\n\r\nMattermost's default websocket factory set `maxPayload` but not `handshakeTimeout`. `createMattermostConnectOnce` waits for the `open` event; when a peer accepts TCP but never completes the websocket upgrade, that wait never ends. Slack relay and browser CDP already bound handshake waits at 30s.\r\n\r\n## Why This Change Was Made\r\n\r\n- Keep a private `buildMattermostWebSocketClientOptions` as the single production options surface (`handshakeTimeout: 30_000`).\r\n- Default Mattermost `WebSocket` factory consumes that builder.\r\n- Regressions observe that production wiring in source (knip-safe; no new unused exports) and prove stalled-handshake timeout returns control to `runWithReconnect`.\r\n\r\nNo new config/env surface.\r\n\r\n## User Impact\r\n\r\n**Before:** A Mattermost host that accepted TCP without completing the websocket handshake could pin the channel reconnect loop forever on that attempt.\r\n\r\n**After:** Handshake waits fail closed after 30s (`WebSocketClosedBeforeOpenError` / close before open), allowing the reconnect loop to continue.\r\n\r\n## Evidence\r\n\r\n- Changed: `extensions/mattermost/src/mattermost/monitor-websocket.ts`\r\n- Production caller: `createMattermostConnectOnce` / `runWithReconnect` (same path as `monitor.ts`)\r\n- Sibling: `extensions/slack/src/monitor/relay-source.ts` (`handshakeTimeout: 30_000`)\r\n- Regression: `extensions/mattermost/src/mattermost/monitor-websocket.test.ts`\r\n- ClawSweeper follow-ups addressed: production-wiring coverage + standalone timeout→reconnect output (including full 30s default-factory floor)\r\n\r\n### Caller-path Vitest\r\n\r\n```bash\r\nnode scripts/run-vitest.mjs extensions/mattermost/src/mattermost/monitor-websocket.test.ts --reporter=verbose\r\n```\r\n\r\n```text\r\n ✓ ... > uses a 30s handshakeTimeout matching Slack relay 1ms\r\n[mattermost handshake proof] timed_out=true name=WebSocketClosedBeforeOpenError message=websocket closed before open (code 1006)\r\n ✓ ... > fails connect when the websocket handshake never completes 203ms\r\n[mattermost handshake reconnect proof] timeout_then_reconnect=true errors=WebSocketClosedBeforeOpenError,WebSocketClosedBeforeOpenError reconnect_delays_ms=50\r\n ✓ ... > returns control to reconnect after a stalled handshake 458ms\r\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\r\n      Tests  14 passed (14)\r\n[test] passed 1 Vitest shard in 8.05s\r\n```\r\n\r\n## Real behavior proof\r\n\r\n**Commands run:**\r\n```bash\r\nnode scripts/run-vitest.mjs extensions/mattermost/src/mattermost/monitor-websocket.test.ts --reporter=verbose\r\nPROOF_MODE=short node /tmp/openclaw-mattermost-handshake-proof/standalone.mjs\r\nPROOF_MODE=default-factory node /tmp/openclaw-mattermost-handshake-proof/standalone.mjs\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Before fix:**\r\nDefault Mattermost `WebSocket` options had no `handshakeTimeout`, so `createMattermostConnectOnce` could wait indefinitely for `open`.\r\n\r\n**After fix:**\r\nProduction builder wires `handshakeTimeout: 30000` into the default factory. Against a TCP peer that accepts but never upgrades:\r\n\r\n1. Short standalone run (200ms stand-in): timeout then reconnect attempt.\r\n2. Default-factory floor (30_000 ms): first attempt fails at ~30s, reconnect schedules, second attempt also times out.\r\n\r\n**Evidence after fix (Vitest):**\r\n```text\r\n[mattermost handshake proof] timed_out=true name=WebSocketClosedBeforeOpenError message=websocket closed before open (code 1006)\r\n[mattermost handshake reconnect proof] timeout_then_reconnect=true errors=WebSocketClosedBeforeOpenError,WebSocketClosedBeforeOpenError reconnect_delays_ms=50\r\n Test Files  1 passed (1)\r\n      Tests  14 passed (14)\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Evidence after fix (standalone, non-Vitest):**\r\n```text\r\n[standalone] source_builder=true source_default_factory_wiring=true production_timeout_ms=30000\r\n[standalone] mode=short hang_tcp_peer=ws://127.0.0.1:56890 handshakeTimeout_ms=200\r\n[standalone] connect_attempt=1\r\n[standalone] timeout_or_error name=WebSocketClosedBeforeOpenError message=websocket closed before open (code 1006) elapsed_ms=204\r\n[standalone] shouldReconnect attempt=0 error=WebSocketClosedBeforeOpenError elapsed_ms=205\r\n[standalone] reconnect_scheduled delay_ms=50\r\n[standalone] connect_attempt=2\r\n[standalone] RESULT timeout_then_reconnect=true connect_attempts=2 errors=WebSocketClosedBeforeOpenError,WebSocketClosedBeforeOpenError reconnect_delays_ms=50 elapsed_ms=457\r\n```\r\n\r\n**Evidence after fix (standalone default-factory 30s floor + reconnect):**\r\n```text\r\n[standalone] mode=default-factory hang_tcp_peer=ws://127.0.0.1:56911 handshakeTimeout_ms=30000\r\n[standalone] connect_attempt=1\r\n[standalone] timeout_or_error name=WebSocketClosedBeforeOpenError message=websocket closed before open (code 1006) elapsed_ms=30004\r\n[standalone] shouldReconnect attempt=0 error=WebSocketClosedBeforeOpenError elapsed_ms=30005\r\n[standalone] reconnect_scheduled delay_ms=50\r\n[standalone] connect_attempt=2\r\n[standalone] timeout_or_error name=WebSocketClosedBeforeOpenError message=websocket closed before open (code 1006) elapsed_ms=60061\r\n[standalone] shouldReconnect attempt=1 error=WebSocketClosedBeforeOpenError elapsed_ms=60069\r\n[standalone] RESULT timeout_then_reconnect=true connect_attempts=2 errors=WebSocketClosedBeforeOpenError,WebSocketClosedBeforeOpenError reconnect_delays_ms=50 elapsed_ms=60069\r\n```\r\n\r\n**What was not tested:**\r\nLive Mattermost Cloud/server credentials; gateway process packaging beyond the production `ws` client options + reconnect policy used by `monitor.ts`.\r\n",
